*----------------------------------------------------------------------*
* Section Screen                                                       *
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*
SELECTION-SCREEN BEGIN OF BLOCK BLK1 WITH FRAME TITLE TEXT-T01.
  PARAMETERS P_SYSID TYPE ZGTPPT4090-ZSYSTEM_ID AS LISTBOX VISIBLE LENGTH 20.
  PARAMETERS P_INSMM TYPE ZGTPPT4090-INSMM.
  PARAMETERS P_WERKS TYPE MARD-WERKS.
  SELECT-OPTIONS S_LGORT FOR MARD-LGORT.
  SELECT-OPTIONS S_SDATE FOR ZGTPPT4090-SDATE.
  SELECT-OPTIONS S_IFDAT FOR ZGTPPT4090-IFDAT DEFAULT SY-DATUM MODIF ID LOG.
SELECTION-SCREEN END OF BLOCK BLK1.

SELECTION-SCREEN BEGIN OF BLOCK BLK2 WITH FRAME TITLE TEXT-T02.
  SELECTION-SCREEN BEGIN OF LINE.
    SELECTION-SCREEN COMMENT (18) TEXT-001.
    PARAMETERS P_SEND RADIOBUTTON  GROUP G1 USER-COMMAND U1 DEFAULT 'X'.
    SELECTION-SCREEN COMMENT (20) TEXT-C11 FOR FIELD P_SEND.
    PARAMETERS P_LOG RADIOBUTTON   GROUP G1.
    SELECTION-SCREEN COMMENT (20) TEXT-C12 FOR FIELD P_LOG.
  SELECTION-SCREEN END OF LINE.

  SELECTION-SCREEN BEGIN OF LINE.
    SELECTION-SCREEN COMMENT (18) TEXT-002                   MODIF ID LOG.
    PARAMETERS P_SUC  RADIOBUTTON  GROUP G2 DEFAULT 'X'      MODIF ID LOG.
    SELECTION-SCREEN COMMENT (20) TEXT-C14 FOR FIELD P_SUC   MODIF ID LOG.
    PARAMETERS P_ERROR RADIOBUTTON GROUP G2                  MODIF ID LOG.
    SELECTION-SCREEN COMMENT (20) TEXT-C15 FOR FIELD P_ERROR MODIF ID LOG.
    PARAMETERS P_TOTAL RADIOBUTTON GROUP G2                  MODIF ID LOG.
    SELECTION-SCREEN COMMENT (20) TEXT-C13 FOR FIELD P_TOTAL MODIF ID LOG.
  SELECTION-SCREEN END OF LINE.
SELECTION-SCREEN END OF BLOCK BLK2.

SELECTION-SCREEN BEGIN OF BLOCK BLK3 WITH FRAME TITLE TEXT-T03.
  PARAMETERS P_BATCH AS CHECKBOX MODIF ID SND.
SELECTION-SCREEN END OF BLOCK BLK3.

*---------------------------------------------------------------------*
* AT SELECTION-SCREEN OUTPUT                                          *
*---------------------------------------------------------------------*
AT SELECTION-SCREEN OUTPUT.
  PERFORM AT_SELECTION_SCREEN_OUTPUT.

*---------------------------------------------------------------------*
* AT SELECTION-SCREEN                                                 *
*---------------------------------------------------------------------*
AT SELECTION-SCREEN.
  PERFORM AT_SELECTION_SCREEN.
